Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,70)\fad(180,220)\fnRoundHog SemiBold\fs32\c&H00DFB32B}Tom Piccirello (PostHog)
Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,132)\fad(180,220)}“The annual pen test is
Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,196)\fad(180,220)}dead. Scan weekly, fix
Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,260)\fad(180,220)}automatically.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,The annual pen test I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:01.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,think is completely
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:03.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,dead. It was always
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:04.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,pretty useless
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:04.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,even with humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.07,0:00:06.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,In the SRE world pre-AI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:07.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,there was always this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.47,0:00:07.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,belief that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.95,0:00:09.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,we should find out if we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:10.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,go down before our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.62,0:00:11.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,customers tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:12.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,And I think the same is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,true of vulnerabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:14.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,We should identify the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:15.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,vulnerabilities before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:16.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,they're reported to us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:17.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,in a bug bounty or
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:18.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,vulnerability disclosure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:19.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,program. And so really
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:21.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,the key there is using
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:22.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,one or several AI red
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:24.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,teaming tools to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:25.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,constantly test your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.02,0:00:26.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,source code and your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:27.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,network to find these
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,things and combine those
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:30.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,findings with automatic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.27,0:00:31.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,remediation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:32.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,automatic PRs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.26,0:00:33.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Testing once a year just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:33.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.95,0:00:34.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,But more than ever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.87,0:00:36.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,you should have weekly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.03,0:00:36.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,scans at a minimum
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:38.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,weekly in-depth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.28,0:00:39.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,high-token scans
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.61,0:00:40.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you should be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.45,0:00:40.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,automatically
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.73,0:00:42.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,remediating what gets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.13,0:00:42.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,found.
